  "summary": {
    "derivative_id": "der:rc4:cb_ef8cfa1cd3c940db8a4710197388e578:summary",
    "text": "Aged Care Deloraine Inc is a not\u2011for\u2011profit provider of aged care services in Deloraine, Tasmania (information current in evidence observed in 2026). It operates two residential care facilities \u2014 Kanangra (48 beds) and Grenoch (47 beds) \u2014 alongside independent living units for people wishing to downscale. Services described include occasional respite care, specialised high\u2011care services including dementia care, and admissions processes with individualised clinical care planning supported by an Admissions Officer and Clinical Care Coordinator. The organisation reports community links in Deloraine, hosts work placements for local students, and offers site tours and admissions consultations for prospective residents and families."
  },
